{"id":"297834c6f058cefe","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-symplectic-form.md","title":"Symplectic Form","display":"df-symplectic-form — Symplectic Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-symplectic-form","aliases":["58-df-symplectic-form"],"display":"df-symplectic-form — Symplectic Form","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md]]","[[./58-df-non-degenerate.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-symplectic-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-symplectic-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symplectic-form — Symplectic Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md\">../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3cb4e8004646c0c\" href=\"?note=a3cb4e8004646c0c\" title=\"./58-df-non-degenerate.md\">58-df-non-degenerate.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\omega,\\theta\\in V\">\\(M,\\omega,\\theta\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span> 为一次调用中共用的流形记录。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(S,p)\">\\(T(S,p)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{S,p}\">\\(0_{S,p}\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-smooth-tensor-data</code>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\theta,\\omega,M,n,k)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\theta,\\omega,M,n,k)\\)</span> 保留既有五元名称，现定义为显式结构关系的存在投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymplecticForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SymplecticForm}_S\\)</span> 保留二元接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\theta,\\eta,M,n,k)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\eta,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\theta,\\eta,M,n,k)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\eta,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SymplecticForm}_S(\\omega,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\theta,S\\;\\bigl[\nS=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\omega,S,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall u,v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\theta(p)(u,v,w)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n[(\\forall w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\omega(p)(v,w)=0)\\to v=0_{S,p}]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SymplecticForm}_S(\\omega,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\theta,S\\;\\bigl[\nS=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\omega,S,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall u,v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\theta(p)(u,v,w)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n[(\\forall w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\omega(p)(v,w)=0)\\to v=0_{S,p}]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭性、非退化性和外微分均在同一光滑结构上检验，原外微分辅助名保留并获得实际定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md","status":"resolved","id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-non-degenerate.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3cb4e8004646c0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-non-degenerate.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\omega,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"T(S,p)","display":false},{"tex":"0_{S,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\theta,\\omega,M,n,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SymplecticForm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivative}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\theta,\\eta,M,n,k)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\eta,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,k).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SymplecticForm}_S(\\omega,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\;\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\theta,S\\;\\bigl[\nS=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\omega,S,2)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall u,v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\theta(p)(u,v,w)=0\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n[(\\forall w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\omega(p)(v,w)=0)\\to v=0_{S,p}]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1680,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c6d7cb9d5ebdb5c","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SymplecticForm}_S$ (closed nondegenerate two-form predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-symplectic-form.md]])"},{"id":"6909e67a0a112410","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymplecticForm}_S$ (closed nondegenerate two-form predicate, see [[58-df-symplectic-form]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-symplectic-form.md|58-df-symplectic-form]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["db62358c2ba471b0","a3cb4e8004646c0c","cd9981d8428c2629","c5f44e08576c6b2e"]}